    <item rdf:about="https://alephnull.com/w/recipes/carrot_cake?rev=1680915253&amp;do=diff">
        <dc:format>text/html</dc:format>
        <dc:date>2023-04-07T20:54:13-0400</dc:date>
        <dc:creator>Anonymous (anonymous@undisclosed.example.com)</dc:creator>
        <title>recipes:carrot_cake</title>
        <link>https://alephnull.com/w/recipes/carrot_cake?rev=1680915253&amp;do=diff</link>
        <description>Carrot Cake (NYT Recipes)
By Dorie Greenspan

1 hour 30 minutes, plus at least 15 minutes' refrigeration
Yield: 8 to 12 servings

INGREDIENTS
For the Cake

	*  2 cups all-purpose flour
	*  2 teaspoons baking powder
	*  2 teaspoons baking soda
	*  2 teaspoons ground cinnamon</description>
    </item>
