        <description>Slow-Cooker Cauliflower, Potato and White Bean Soup  (NYT)

YIELD:6 servings 
TIME:8 hours and 25 minutes 

INGREDIENTS

	*  1 pound Yukon gold potatoes, scrubbed, peeled and cut into 1- to 2-inch chunks 
	*  1 pound cauliflower, chopped into large bite-sized florets and stems</description>
    </item>
