    <item rdf:about="https://alephnull.com/w/recipes/naan_bread?rev=1643746576&amp;do=diff">
        <dc:format>text/html</dc:format>
        <dc:date>2022-02-01T15:16:16-0400</dc:date>
        <dc:creator>Anonymous (anonymous@undisclosed.example.com)</dc:creator>
        <title>recipes:naan_bread</title>
        <link>https://alephnull.com/w/recipes/naan_bread?rev=1643746576&amp;do=diff</link>
        <description>Naan bread recipe! 

Makes: about 8 pieces

Prep: 1 hour 20 minutes

Ingredients:

	*  1 tsp sugar
	*  1/2 cup warm water
	*  1/4oz (2 1/4 tsp) active dry yeast
	*  2 1/4 cups all-purpose flour
	*  1/2 cup plain yogurt (greek is fine, or regular)
	*</description>
    </item>
    <item rdf:about="https://alephnull.com/w/recipes/goat_cheese_pasta_salad?rev=1497913187&amp;do=diff">
