        <description>Slow Cooker Split Pea Soup With Horseradish Cream (NYT)
By Sarah DiGregorio

Yield: 6 to 8 servings 

INGREDIENTS

	*  3 tablespoons olive oil
	*  1 yellow or red onion, minced
	*  3 celery stalks, thinly sliced
	*  1 large carrot, chopped
	*  5 large garlic cloves, smashed and chopped</description>
    </item>
    <item rdf:about="https://alephnull.com/w/recipes/roasted_cauliflower_and_farro?rev=1638472479&amp;do=diff">
