        <description>Southern Black-eyed Peas
Ingredients:

	*  1 pound (453 gms) dry black-eyed peas
	*  4-5 thick slices of (turkey) bacon
	*  1 cup smoked sausage or turkey, diced
	*  1 large onion, diced
	*  2-3 teaspoons minced garlic
	*  1 jalapeno, minced, or replace with cayenne pepper (optional)</description>
